    "title": "'We craved external validation, but what's important has shifted': Dubai gallery The Third Line celebrates 20 years - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Melissa Gronlund ,\n17 hours ago Though the present moment in the Gulf art scene is portrayed as one of novelty and transformation, many of its key entities have grown into venerable players. Turning 20 this year are the region's biggest fair, Art Dubai, one of its largest institutional undertakings, the Saadiyat Museums Project in Abu Dhabi, and one of its leading commercial galleries, The Third Line, which celebrates its anniversary this week. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
